# Scenario A -- cold rollout under load.
#
# The new revision looks for weights in an empty directory, so it must download and
# load them before it can serve. With maxSurge:0 the fleet is at N-1 for that whole
# window, and then the pod that arrives is Ready but still cold.
#
# Two failures overlap, which is what makes this the richest of the three:
#   1. capacity loss for the download-plus-load window
#   2. a cold pod absorbing its full share the instant it reports Ready
#
# The path stays under the hostPath mount, so this downloads to the data disk without
# touching the warm cache the stable pods are using. Cleanup removes it.
HF_HOME_PATH=/root/.cache/huggingface/cold-${RUN_ID}
